Don't do this:

> "Cursor, build Phase 1 completely."



Instead:

> "Read the Phase 1 specification. First explain the architecture and create DESIGN.md. Do not implement yet."



Then:

> "Implement milestone 1 only. Add tests."



Then:

> "Run the tests and explain any failures."



This will make Cursor your coding accelerator, while you remain the person learning the architecture.


